 "lyrics": [
  {
   "start": 12.6,
   "end": 16.5,
   "text": "Someday you'll come back here"
  },
  {
   "start": 18.6,
   "end": 22.2,
   "text": "And you'll open up your arms"
  },
  {
   "start": 24.7,
   "end": 30.9,
   "text": "And you'll laugh and say I knew it wouldn't take you long"
  },
  {
   "start": 31.5,
   "end": 34.8,
   "text": "To realize I was gone"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.5,
   "end": 40.7,
   "text": "And it's only been three years"
  },
  {
   "start": 42.5,
   "end": 46.3,
   "text": "But to me it's been so long"
  },
  {
   "start": 48.5,
   "end": 52.7,
   "text": "And I remember it like yesterday"
  },
  {
   "start": 53.0,
   "end": 54.8,
   "text": "Oh you could say"
  },
  {
   "start": 55.1,
   "end": 58.5,
   "text": "I've been holding on"
  },
  {
   "start": 59.5,
   "end": 64.2,
   "text": "And I waited all of my life"
  },
  {
   "start": 64.7,
   "end": 67.6,
   "text": "For you to make it right"
  },
  {
   "start": 67.7,
   "end": 70.9,
   "text": "But the time has come and gone"
  },
  {
   "start": 71.6,
   "end": 76.3,
   "text": "And it's faded and lost all its light"
  },
  {
   "start": 76.5,
   "end": 79.8,
   "text": "A star that shines so bright"
  },
  {
   "start": 80.0,
   "end": 82.8,
   "text": "Falls from the sky"
  },
  {
   "start": 84.0,
   "end": 88.5,
   "text": "Don't make a wish that won't come true"
  },
  {
   "start": 88.7,
   "end": 91.4,
   "text": "And I learned that from you"
  },
  {
   "start": 91.7,
   "end": 94.5,
   "text": "Such a long time ago"
  },
  {
   "start": 95.8,
   "end": 100.3,
   "text": "When you left you said you had to find"
  },
  {
   "start": 100.6,
   "end": 103.4,
   "text": "A better way of life"
  },
  {
   "start": 103.7,
   "end": 106.7,
   "text": "This one just wouldn't do"
  },
  {
   "start": 107.6,
   "end": 112.3,
   "text": "And I waited all of my life"
  },
  {
   "start": 112.6,
   "end": 115.6,
   "text": "For you to take your time"
  },
  {
   "start": 115.8,
   "end": 119.2,
   "text": "To find your place"
  },
  {
   "start": 119.8,
   "end": 123.4,
   "text": "But I learned that this world still turns without you"
  },
  {
   "start": 123.5,
   "end": 127.4,
   "text": "And you were just a phase and I learned without you here"
  },
  {
   "start": 127.6,
   "end": 130.2,
   "text": "I was happier alone"
  },
  {
   "start": 130.5,
   "end": 133.5,
   "text": "Than I ever would have known"
  },
  {
   "start": 156.0,
   "end": 160.3,
   "text": "And I waited, I waited"
  },
  {
   "start": 162.0,
   "end": 167.8,
   "text": "And I waited, I waited, I waited"
  },
  {
   "start": 168.0,
   "end": 172.8,
   "text": "And I waited all of my life"
  },
  {
   "start": 173.0,
   "end": 176.0,
   "text": "For you to take your time"
  },
  {
   "start": 176.2,
   "end": 179.5,
   "text": "But the time has come and gone"
  },
  {
   "start": 180.0,
   "end": 184.8,
   "text": "And it's faded and lost all its light"
  },
  {
   "start": 185.0,
   "end": 188.0,
   "text": "A star that shines so bright"
  },
  {
   "start": 188.2,
   "end": 190.7,
   "text": "Falls from the sky"
  },
  {
   "start": 190.8,
   "end": 195.0,
   "text": "On this cold December night"
  }
 ],
